      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners frequently mention the gentle treatment and genuine affection shown toward their dogs and cats. Multiple reviews describe veterinarians who take time to calm stressed animals and treat family pets with warmth and personal attention during routine physical exams and vaccinations."
      }
